From: ninjacornix <milanvrankic@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 17:26:55 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(editor): stock icons in Joinery's muted ink

Joinery-only, not for upstream. Buttons, flat buttons and menu buttons tint their icons with Joinery's
muted text colour at rest and the text colour on hover, so Godot's icons
next to the sidebar's read as one set. The viewport's overlay buttons
(the View menu, "Perspective") keep their dark ground over the scene but
take the toolbar's md radius and compact padding.
---
 editor/themes/editor_theme_manager.cpp | 25 +++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 25 insertions(+)

diff --git a/editor/themes/editor_theme_manager.cpp b/editor/themes/editor_theme_manager.cpp
index ff41f5a..3d956d8 100644
--- a/editor/themes/editor_theme_manager.cpp
+++ b/editor/themes/editor_theme_manager.cpp
@@ -608,6 +608,31 @@ static void _joinery_populate_styles(const Ref<EditorTheme> &p_theme, const Edit
 		p_theme->set_stylebox("fill", "JoineryProgress", fill);
 	}
 
+	// Stock icons beside Joinery's own glyphs (scene dock, inspector, file dock
+	// and viewport toolbars): the same muted ink at rest and the text colour on
+	// hover, so Godot's filled icons and the sidebar's line icons read as one
+	// set. Coloured icons only darken a little under the muted ink.
+	for (const StringName &type : { SNAME("Button"), SNAME("FlatButton"), SNAME("MenuButton"), SNAME("FlatMenuButton"), SNAME("MenuBar") }) {
+		p_theme->set_color("icon_normal_color", type, text_muted);
+		p_theme->set_color("icon_focus_color", type, text_muted);
+		p_theme->set_color("icon_hover_color", type, text);
+		p_theme->set_color("icon_hover_pressed_color", type, text);
+	}
+
+	// The viewport's View menu ("Perspective") and its other overlay buttons:
+	// still dark over the 3D scene so they read on any picture, but shaped like
+	// the toolbar's buttons above it, md radius and the same compact padding.
+	{
+		Ref<StyleBoxFlat> overlay = p_theme->get_stylebox("Information3dViewport", EditorStringName(EditorStyles));
+		if (overlay.is_valid()) {
+			overlay = overlay->duplicate();
+			overlay->set_corner_radius_all(radius);
+			overlay->set_content_margin_individual(8 * EDSCALE, 4 * EDSCALE, 10 * EDSCALE, 4 * EDSCALE);
+			overlay->set_border_width_all(0);
+			p_theme->set_stylebox("Information3dViewport", EditorStringName(EditorStyles), overlay);
+		}
+	}
+
 	// The wordmark in the Project Manager: title size, semibold, in the plain
 	// font colour, drawn as a flat button so it opens About. Flush left, so it
 	// shares the page's left edge with the line and the bar under it.
